{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "5544c7768abf7dd3082197a8db9f1a8a5855ad6ae96d19bb6d58d0e2d255710f", "ja": "めぐりあい☆ジャングル", "zh": "邂逅☆丛林", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "842726fdb5b4832a1b12ff9f2170a00605db0a1de7c78960cdfce5957c33b202", "ja": "メンバーは突然、ジャングルの中にいた。\n今までの異変は全て、アイドル同士の激突を\n憂いた劇場の魂の仕業だった。劇場の魂は\nみんなを仲良くさせるため、本人たちには\n恥ずかしさしかない苦行を強いる……。", "zh": "成员们突然置身于丛林之中。\n至今为止发生的所有异变，都是剧场之魂因忧虑偶像们之间的冲突而造成的。为了让大家和睦相处，剧场之魂强迫她们进行一场对本人们来说只有羞耻的苦修……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1001_null", "source_sha256": "ebccda250599ca45397d46ac1cf9d800f247f39a4faac4d7e6510dbeb834eb50", "ja": "チュンチュン、チチチチ……\nバサッ、バサバサッ！", "zh": "啾啾，啾啾啾啾……\n扑棱，扑棱扑棱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "9e7368d9ab7fb3d7b248248fcaad60a1831822b25da836c693b66db6c57eb5ba", "ja": "あら……。ここ、どこかしら……？\n私、また迷子になってしまったみたい……？", "zh": "哎呀……这里是哪里呢……？\n我好像又迷路了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "4ee7112caf97037e7e807d16ead61f53057c03a3a136392220cb6ca7255fa653", "ja": "ええっ！？　あ、あずさちゃん、\nこんなの迷子ってレベルじゃないわよ！", "zh": "诶！？啊、啊梓，这已经不是迷路的程度了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "44170378904c3d240b27ac14270d93ad7357db16e751cc36692fa3c219183019", "ja": "わ、私たち、さっきまで劇場にいましたよね？\n一体何が……！？", "zh": "我、我们刚才明明还在剧场里的吧？\n到底发生了什么……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "bd12ef73535ac7e86c1898df1b4104b86a48ad181745b2cced41028d82973398", "ja": "あっちにおっきな建物が見えるヨ！？　スゴーイ！", "zh": "那边能看到一座好大的建筑物耶！？好厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "3c706c36531ff4f79574d7fca7dc0746f22989aec2f32a0415917f9e7df9c3dd", "ja": "うーん、標高はそんなに高くなさそうだけど……\nなんだろう？　この感じ……どこかで……。", "zh": "嗯——海拔好像没那么高……  \n这是怎么回事？这种感觉……好像在哪里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1007_se", "source_sha256": "f3ca7ef58c7296c3009a40049deb9d7ab138a4aab93695aed6026e97f286aa2c", "ja": "カガッ……ガー！　ピー、ガガ……", "zh": "咔嚓……滋——！　哔、滋滋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "6d5819071593bce22e3f01b906188a5c3385db89a5bc37fd1f28a5356a6f824e", "ja": "「……あ、あー。マイクテス、ワンツー……\nテス、テス……OK」", "zh": "“……喂、喂——。试麦，一二……\n试音，试音……OK”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ae5498ac3d7d3801efcc08089e6268d417ab40cf41e841cf0c6e4daa69510d88", "ja": "えっ！？　この声……真美ちゃん？\nあの建物の方から聞こえてくるみたい……。", "zh": "诶！？这个声音……是真美吗？\n好像是从那栋建筑那边传来的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "22450750820bf4556b8e5b34412b90171244df2029712115ab1bca158b08954c", "ja": "「……違うわ。今は私が、真美ちゃんの\n体を借りているだけ。真美ちゃんのせいじゃない」", "zh": "“……不是的。现在只是我借用了真美的\n身体而已。这不是真美的错”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "71e002ed1765fb1efa5af7318b5b060205ada82483fe173c44ef5489c8e88448", "ja": "「私は劇場の魂。みんなの夢のカケラから生まれた、\nアイドル達を愛する存在……」", "zh": "「我是剧场的灵魂。是由大家的梦想碎片所诞生、\n深爱着偶像们的存在……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "ddc83891983260398961ed1696a6bcc5ea55b23d93ee0e7ef3a426eb1d40b50f", "ja": "劇場の……魂……あ、あーっ！？　ゲキコ！", "zh": "剧场的……灵魂……啊、啊——！？剧场子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "1edba7853d5ebf031b576df3eef11385f50e36f7290786400584bc659bc5f3a0", "ja": "わーい！　こんにちは、げき子ちゃん♪", "zh": "哇——！你好呀，剧场子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "577d8584f1c3c10bb25bb1a2b46dfabf1343fa3676fce49dca7e47cd78be4c49", "ja": "え、劇場の魂？　げき子？　な、なにそれ？", "zh": "诶，剧场的灵魂？小剧？那、那是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "f840c9d6fc0461811bc33c342be0e5ae1f1099df67459c6b5733526e9584cc90", "ja": "「私は、劇場の意志そのもの。エレナちゃん、\n麗花ちゃん、思い出してくれたんだ？　嬉しい……」", "zh": "“我是剧场的意志本身。艾蕾娜、丽花，你们想起我了啊？好开心……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1016_012mam", "source_sha256": "b34f31fa7751ba6e87df78c391ac5a9dc0150d58c9e62a5f139775ad0ed548bb", "ja": "「黙って見てるつもりだったけど……やっぱりダメ。\n耐えられない。私、アイドルのみんなが大好きだから」", "zh": "「我本来打算默默看着的……但果然还是不行。\n受不了了。因为我，最喜欢偶像大家了」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "66cd13092aee9b1531eb2c6cf747a68bba62ae438689a979778bd4dd089fef97", "ja": "「なので……バトルなんかしたくなくなるように、\nみんなには、仲良くなってもらいます」", "zh": "「所以……为了让大家变得不想再搞什么对决，\n我要让大家全都搞好关系」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "27b276fc8ec4d6a3d4bee9b81ac303db1530240dbdefb84d82a904ba86a41fc6", "ja": "えっ……どうするノ？", "zh": "诶……要怎么办呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "012ebf7350dcd8bd0d67982fe1ddd111333d6944a1ae180f91e9911535e9c57d", "ja": "「まだ秘密……仲良くなるまで帰さないから。\n覚悟ができたら、この劇場に入ってきて……」", "zh": "“还不能说……在变得亲近之前，我不会让你回去的。\n做好觉悟后，就进这座剧场来吧……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "326b36239d5633f67fe0a0d65f4bfa062fc14006125373b629f0015e4d86b979", "ja": "劇場って、あの古代遺跡みたいな建物のこと？\nど、どうします……？", "zh": "剧场就是指那栋像古代遗迹一样的建筑吗？\n我、我们该怎么办……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "5baf3427c6e83c29577ad5d692c6d359d0b873787dde10a2280ea3e183b50a02", "ja": "とりあえず、行ってみましょうか～。\nあれだけ目立つ建物なら、迷わなそうだし……。", "zh": "总之，先去看看吧～。\n那么显眼的建筑，应该不会迷路……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "0f993f502d45e248d7f3203175f20530e690228863ef4b24334f41cc6e2ad805", "ja": "へえ……。中は、意外と普通の劇場なのね。", "zh": "哦……里面意外地就是普通的剧场呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "97370e484c67f89ddc48993fff6ce451f791805925e1cd3b35b0b4bbdaf7a7a2", "ja": "あ、見て！　スクリーンに文字が……！", "zh": "啊，你看！屏幕上出现文字了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1025_012mam", "source_sha256": "3c71c4c157ac3a6fe6ffd64afefb4e50f0c4c45fd6842647908f04bbe05214e3", "ja": "「じゃーん、仲良し企画そのいち……\n『お互いを知ろう！　モノマネ大会☆』！　わ～！」", "zh": "“噔噔——！增进感情企划第一弹……\n『互相了解吧！模仿大赛☆』！哇～！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "87987431f33f43466d45eb68d8e607e3060349ef0795f4d204646a53d7015abd", "ja": "きゅ、急にバラエティ番組みたいなのが\n始まっちゃった！？", "zh": "突、突然就开始了像综艺节目一样的东西！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1027_012mam", "source_sha256": "76e9eee6c748a31ed56c776725a8f492f0e22adf3b8c21528d542d0c1e2b18d5", "ja": "「モノマネをしたら、仲良くなれると思うから……\nあずさちゃん、エレナちゃんのモノマネしてみて？」", "zh": "“因为我觉得模仿对方的话，就能拉近彼此的关系……\n梓姐姐，你来模仿一下艾琳娜吧？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1028_010azu", "source_sha256": "0b940d1abebde62de5d35be92f54e4df52f4e53915e1948e09033f0910b121c1", "ja": "あらあら～……じゃあ、ちょっとだけ\nやってみようかしら～？　……コホン。", "zh": "哎呀呀～……那么，要不要稍微试一下呢～？……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1029_010azu", "source_sha256": "372b2d1bf901e604874c96f6fd3d5fd5c79bbbaad8a25dcf0f4921c1041ed639", "ja": "ハーイ！　みんな、エレナだヨ～♪　ワタシと\nサンバを踊って、悲しい気分を吹き飛ばしちゃお！", "zh": "嗨！大家好，我是艾蕾娜哟～♪ 和我一起跳桑巴，把悲伤的心情统统吹跑吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "5cb9700574611c7f16c8ba1f57d13f5e9edb04f717a7a19a5a75c0acd60dcec6", "ja": "ワオ！？　アズサ、似てるかも～！\nなんだか嬉しいナ～、エヘヘッ♪", "zh": "哇！？　梓，说不定还挺像的～！\n不知怎么的，好开心呀～，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1031_012mam", "source_sha256": "011cf69cb5ee076781dd2a46b48a8fc32e9dcd99397a422425536a29aca9c4ae", "ja": "「ふふ……じゃあ次は、風花ちゃん。\n麗花ちゃんのモノマネを……どうぞ～？」", "zh": "呵呵……那么接下来是风花。  \n请模仿一下丽花——来吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1032_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a6e99f9d8a1eec72d415c020e564893f502f3e9c33686c90fbba978aa47f842d", "ja": "うぅ……強制的に、本人の目の前で\nモノマネなんて、罰ゲームなんじゃ……こほん。", "zh": "呜……强制在本人面前模仿什么的，\n根本就是惩罚游戏吧……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f0f7e6d457dd76f59788cf01c61d4c94f7d6270d3b4b3cb7bc5ae03bcfe4ef70", "ja": "や……ヤッホー！　北上麗花です♪\n好きな腹筋は、腹斜筋です！　ららら～♪", "zh": "呀……呀吼！我是北上丽花♪\n喜欢的腹肌，是腹斜肌！啦啦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "1994d7a89aead3d17d0c3714958205fab61d74bd9c8f08abb4fd0d007caa3cef", "ja": "わあ♪　風花さん、とっても上手ですね！\n私もハモっちゃおうっと、ららら～♪", "zh": "哇♪　风花小姐，唱得真好呢！\n我也来和声吧，啦啦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1035_012mam", "source_sha256": "59c065176637515656a3632ae486488cebe4a646361b3c3ff15715488dc5e3be", "ja": "「いい感じ……みんな、仲良くなってきた。ふふ」", "zh": "“感觉不错……大家关系越来越好了。呵呵”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1036_039kon", "source_sha256": "4b10b05b888c8e7969497ef2897c1e957eb3e20d25afbaf078c7f2ca4077d281", "ja": "そ、そうなの……？", "zh": "是、是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1037_012mam", "source_sha256": "03687bc12e9335d99462591e367e7f5bb9253bbaea9330142aaef646f1c9cdac", "ja": "「場が温まったところで……いよいよ次の企画。\n『思い出して！　みんなの仲良しメモリーズ』！」", "zh": "“在现场气氛热起来之际……终于到了下一个企划。\n『回想起来吧！大家感情深厚的回忆』！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1038_048rei", "source_sha256": "ade35e6b888a4e1ce20c5ef0d81eb6f064eecfee5eb98640cbb6001c5fbca232", "ja": "わーい、ドンドンパフパフ～♪\nあっ、見て見て、映像が流れ始めたよ！", "zh": "哇——咚咚啪啪～♪\n啊，快看快看，视频开始播放了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1039_010azu", "source_sha256": "32fa1d6ecacc02134d6430b40f86c9a629bbe9b5445acf18e6562adf41842923", "ja": "あ、そうそう！\nええっと……麗花ちゃん、これをどうぞ～♪", "zh": "啊，对了对了！\n那个……丽花，这个给你～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1040_048rei", "source_sha256": "c4b79f80c2384c4e60ee148ba8c61e898aa8e8d45b56c652ab3b43d7e46c6e0e", "ja": "え……あ、あああー！！！\nそのピッケルは……ピッくん！！！", "zh": "诶……啊、啊啊啊——！！！\n那把冰镐是……小冰镐！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1041_048rei", "source_sha256": "1189d2a847d04a55f77f5268ce32d0bea887bb3141489a90a1eb42f224e70bdf", "ja": "ピッくん、ピッくん……！\nうう、また会えると思ってなかったよぉ！", "zh": "皮君、皮君……！\n呜呜，没想到还能再见到你呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1042_048rei", "source_sha256": "073a77445e3b8b94e750dfbb4f0074013b867d5bc7a44d3da136ed18ff221397", "ja": "あれ？　これって……あずささんが、\n私のピッケルのピッくんを探してくれた時の？", "zh": "咦？这不是……梓姐帮我找我的镐子小皮克时的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1043_012mam", "source_sha256": "a80a62f6aee8e768d24b771faa359262b6193c1336969967f9c6a744e994bf22", "ja": "「そう。私が作ったダイジェスト映像、みんなの分\nあるから。見たらきっと仲良しになれる……」", "zh": "“对。我做了集锦视频，每个人\n都有份。看了之后肯定就能搞好关系了……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1044_039kon", "source_sha256": "fdd1b143545a061da1b0fb7e7ff2945893bad15a804325e3c56a222f2b6497b2", "ja": "ええ。真美ちゃんは、お姉ちゃんでしょ？\n私も妹がいるから、わかる気がしたの。", "zh": "嗯。真美是姐姐对吧？\n因为我也有妹妹，所以感觉很能理解呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1045_null", "source_sha256": "84a00a33777a121d39480e954e1c8fab2a25f4eb58f2f3d7eab7aeabe7d957a0", "ja": "～中略～", "zh": "～中间省略～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1046_039kon", "source_sha256": "bdf0d7eb80b1701feb2035812edf548050708f7974201b78b37e35ef51869569", "ja": "ウフフ♪　お姉ちゃんって、大変よね！", "zh": "呵呵♪当姐姐也很辛苦呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1047_012mam", "source_sha256": "0f92578eb6c6baaaf65a1f21da51821f771c6e74d8ab0dcd4c0854845ac3fe46", "ja": "ね～っ！　……えへへ。", "zh": "就是说嘛～！……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1048_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1a18a2342c4871087d27f01696f58bfa830e90ef1e72e625df2ae899c6131471", "ja": "全部、みんなで手作りでしたしね！\n感慨もひとしおって感じで……ぐすっ。", "zh": "全部都是大家亲手做的呢！\n感觉感慨特别深……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1049_018ele", "source_sha256": "ad9e28851fdf0703372a5bb12f6df7796caa7e19910e9fbf1b24044bfa9c1df3", "ja": "あ、フーカったら泣いてるー！　……でも、\nぐすっ。気持ちわかるヨー……！", "zh": "啊，风花居然哭了～！……不过，\n抽泣。我懂你的心情喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1051_039kon", "source_sha256": "ac803cf804d47cafdc7b1492dace666c5bd88d8f1337707fa5ce3a23f138af7b", "ja": "ま、待って待って！　これ、あとどれくらい続くの？\nこの、結婚式のメモリアル映像みたいなやつ……！", "zh": "等、等等！这个还要播多久啊？\n就这个像婚礼纪念视频一样的东西……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1052_012mam", "source_sha256": "c9e57183dd530ba3ffe1a9be84258139d8c4c04b2ae1dce7fe766a2c7d3ff366", "ja": "「ん。短めにまとめたけど……\nフルで10時間くらいかな」", "zh": "“嗯。虽然已经尽量浓缩过了……\n但完整看下来大概要10小时吧”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_04_1053_041fuk", "source_sha256": "df5a7509fddb8b8aff1310299c5db11b906ce0714eb5926803a9691cf187ce74", "ja": "た、助けて、{$P$}さーん！", "zh": "救、救命啊，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
